WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.246
Morgan reviews the Harbor brief and writes a correction: “The facilitator note says available for review.”

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.793
It does not say confirmed to teach.

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:10.998
The draft is fixed.

00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:13.829
A week later, another request comes in.

00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:16.509
Should the agent remember that correction?

00:00:16.952 --> 00:00:17.841
Yes, perhaps.

00:09:53.796 --> 00:09:57.000
The next lesson will place these pieces on one operating map.
